# 🎫 6. Help Desk Ticket

## Ticket: Shared Mailbox Access

### User Issue

> "My normal email works, but I cannot access the department's shared mailbox."

### Information Gathering

Ask:

1. When did the issue start?
2. Were you able to access it previously?
3. Can other users access the shared mailbox?
4. Does your normal mailbox work?
5. Can you access Outlook Web?
6. What error message appears?
7. Did your role or department recently change?
8. Were any Microsoft 365 changes recently made?

### Troubleshooting

```text
Normal mailbox works?
        ↓
Test Outlook Web
        ↓
Test shared mailbox
        ↓
Check shared mailbox permissions
        ↓
Check Send As / Send on Behalf if sending is affected
        ↓
Check Outlook client/profile if web access works
        ↓
Check Microsoft 365 service health
        ↓
Apply authorized fix
        ↓
Verify
        ↓
Document
        ↓
Close / Escalate
```

### Important

Do not immediately recreate the Outlook profile or change permissions without identifying the cause.

