# 🗣️ 7. Behavioral Interview Practice

## Question

**How do you prioritize multiple Help Desk tickets?**

### Professional Answer

> I prioritize tickets based on business impact, severity, urgency, number of users affected, security impact, and the applicable SLA. For example, an outage affecting an entire department would normally receive a higher priority than a low-impact issue affecting only one user. I also consider whether the issue prevents critical business operations or creates a security risk.

