# 🔄 8. Troubleshooting Methodology

Today's troubleshooting approach follows:

```text
1. Gather Information
        ↓
2. Understand the Symptoms
        ↓
3. Identify Possible Causes
        ↓
4. Start With Basic Checks
        ↓
5. Collect Evidence
        ↓
6. Apply Authorized Fix
        ↓
7. Verify With User
        ↓
8. Document
        ↓
9. Close / Escalate
```

### Core principle

> **Do not guess or make unnecessary changes. Investigate first and use evidence to identify the likely cause.**

